       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
         SPECIAL-NAMES. DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

            SELECT ENTRADA1 ASSIGN TO SYS001.
            SELECT ENTRADA2 ASSIGN TO SYS002.
            SELECT FICHA    ASSIGN TO SYS003.
            SELECT SALIDA   ASSIGN TO SYS004.
      *
       IDMS-CONTROL SECTION.
        PROTOCOL.
           MODE IS BATCH-AUTOSTATUS
           IDMS-RECORDS MANUAL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD   ENTRADA1
            LABEL RECORD STANDARD
            RECORDING MODE IS F
            RECORD CONTAINS 100
            DATA RECORD IS WS-ENTRADA1
            BLOCK 0 RECORDS.
       01   WS-ENTRADA1.
            05 FILLER        PIC X(100).

       FD   ENTRADA2
            LABEL RECORD STANDARD
            RECORDING MODE IS F
            RECORD CONTAINS 50
            DATA RECORD IS WS-ENTRADA2
            BLOCK 0 RECORDS.
       01   WS-ENTRADA2.
            05 FILLER        PIC X(50).

       FD   FICHA
            LABEL RECORD STANDARD
            RECORDING MODE IS F
            BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS.
            COPY RC37000.

       FD  SALIDA
           LABEL RECORD STANDARD
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS.
       COPY SAPASTON.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 FILLER.
          03 FILLER             PIC X(17) VALUE 'INICIO DE WORKING'.

          03 SW-FIN-F01                PIC X.
             88 SI-FIN-F01             VALUE 'S'.
             88 NO-FIN-F01             VALUE 'N'.

          03 SW-FIN-F02                PIC X.
             88 SI-FIN-F02             VALUE 'S'.
             88 NO-FIN-F02             VALUE 'N'.

          03 CT-LEIDOS-VEN             PIC 9(08) VALUE ZEROES.
          03 CT-LEIDOS-CCV             PIC 9(08) VALUE ZEROES.
          03 CT-SAPASTON               PIC 9(08) VALUE ZEROES.
          03 WS-FECHA-DESDE            PIC X(08) VALUE SPACES.
          03 WS-FECHA-HASTA            PIC X(08) VALUE SPACES.
          03 WS-SAP-KMODALIDAD.
             05 FILLER                 PIC X(2) VALUE 'V0'.
             05 WS-SAP-MODALIDAD       PIC X(3).
          03 WS-VEN0-KEXPEDIENTE       PIC X(10).
          03 WS-VEN0-NSUBPOLIZA        PIC X(4).
          03 WS-VEN0-KCERTIFICADO      PIC X(6).
          03 WS-VEN0-KMODALIDAD        PIC X(4).
          03 IMP-DEBE                  PIC 9(12)V9(02).
          03 IMP-HABER                 PIC 9(12)V9(02).

          03 LT-VA562086               PIC X(08) VALUE 'VA562086'.

          03 WS-FECHA-DIA.
             05 WS-ANO-DIA              PIC 9(04) VALUE ZEROES.
             05 WS-MES-DIA              PIC 9(02) VALUE ZEROES.
             05 WS-DIA-DIA              PIC 9(02) VALUE ZEROES.

          03 WS-FECHA-INI.
             05 WS-ANO-INI              PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
             05 WS-MES-INI              PIC X(02) VALUE '01'.
             05 WS-DIA-INI              PIC X(02) VALUE '01'.

          03 REG-ENTRADA-VEN.
             05 RG-VEN0-ANIO            PIC S9(4)V USAGE COMP-3.
             05 RG-VEN0-KEXPEDIENTE     PIC S9(10)V USAGE COMP-3.
             05 RG-VEN0-KPOLIZA         PIC X(10).
             05 RG-VEN0-NSUBPOLIZA      PIC S9(4)V USAGE COMP-3.
             05 RG-VEN0-KCERTIFICADO    PIC S9(6)V USAGE COMP-3.
             05 RG-VEN0-KMODALIDAD      PIC S9(5)V USAGE COMP-3.
             05 RG-VEN0-CCANALCAMP      PIC X(2).
             05 RG-VEN0-FECEFECTO       PIC X(8).
             05 RG-VEN0-KOFICINA        PIC X(4).
             05 RG-VEN0-IMPCAPITAL      PIC S9(11)V9(2) USAGE COMP-3.
             05 RG-VEN0-IMPBENEFICIOS   PIC S9(11)V9(2) USAGE COMP-3.
             05 FILLER                  PIC X(14).

          03 REG-ENTRADA-CCV.
             05 RG-CCV0-ANIO            PIC S9(4)V USAGE COMP-3.
             05 RG-CCV0-KEXPEDIENTE     PIC S9(10)V USAGE COMP-3.
             05 RG-CCV0-IMPCOA          PIC S9(11)V9(2) USAGE COMP-3.
             05 RG-CCV0-OK              PIC X(1).
             05 FILLER                  PIC X(19).
      *
       COPY RA562086.
      *
           03 FILLER PIC X(40) VALUE 'FINAL WORKING-STORAGE SECTION'.
      *
      *****************************************************************
      ***           P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N            ***
      *****************************************************************
      *
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       PRINCIPAL.

           PERFORM INICIO.
           PERFORM PROCESO UNTIL SI-FIN-F01.
           PERFORM FIN.
      *
      *****************************************************************
      *
      *****************************************************************
       INICIO.
      ********
      *
           OPEN INPUT ENTRADA1 ENTRADA2 FICHA
                OUTPUT SALIDA.

           INITIALIZE IMP-DEBE IMP-HABER R-ASTOS-SAP
                      CT-LEIDOS-VEN CT-LEIDOS-CCV CT-SAPASTON.

           INITIALIZE RA562086.
           MOVE 'A' TO RA562086-COPERACION.
           CALL LT-VA562086 USING RA562086.

           SET NO-FIN-F01   TO TRUE
           SET NO-FIN-F02   TO TRUE

           PERFORM LEER-FECHA.
           PERFORM LEER-VEN.
           PERFORM LEER-CCV.

           IF NO-FIN-F01
              PERFORM GRABAR-REG11.
      *
      *****************************************************************
      *
      *****************************************************************
       PROCESO.
      *********
      *
           PERFORM GRABAR-REG22.
           PERFORM LEER-VEN.
           PERFORM LEER-CCV.
      *
      *****************************************************************
       FIN.
      *****
      *
           PERFORM GRABAR-REG22-TOTALES.
           PERFORM GRABAR-REG33.

           INITIALIZE RA562086.
           MOVE 'C' TO RA562086-COPERACION.
           CALL LT-VA562086 USING RA562086.

           CLOSE SALIDA ENTRADA1 ENTRADA2.

      *D*
           DISPLAY ' * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *'.
           DISPLAY ' *   F I N      V B 3 7 2 K 0 2      *'.
           DISPLAY ' * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *'.
           DISPLAY ' *  REG. LEIDOS DE VEN...: ' CT-LEIDOS-VEN.
           DISPLAY ' *  REG. LEIDOS DE CCV...: ' CT-LEIDOS-CCV.
           DISPLAY ' * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *'.
           DISPLAY ' *  LINEAS EN SAPASTON...: ' CT-SAPASTON.
           DISPLAY ' * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *'.
      *F*
           GOBACK.
      *
       LEER-FECHA.
      *************
      *
           READ FICHA
             AT END
      *D*
                 DISPLAY ' * * * FECHA NO INDICADA EN FICHERO FICHA'
      *F*
           END-READ.
      *
      *
       LEER-VEN.
      *************
      *
           INITIALIZE REG-ENTRADA-VEN.

           READ ENTRADA1
                AT END
                   SET SI-FIN-F01   TO TRUE
                NOT AT END
                   ADD  1           TO CT-LEIDOS-VEN
                   MOVE WS-ENTRADA1 TO REG-ENTRADA-VEN
           END-READ.
      *
       LEER-CCV.
      *************
      *
           INITIALIZE REG-ENTRADA-CCV.

           READ ENTRADA2
                AT END
                   SET SI-FIN-F02   TO TRUE
                NOT AT END
                   ADD  1           TO CT-LEIDOS-CCV
                   MOVE WS-ENTRADA2 TO REG-ENTRADA-CCV
           END-READ.
      *
      *****************
       GRABAR-REG11.
      *****************
      *
           INITIALIZE R-ASTOS-SAP.

           MOVE 'XG'          TO INTERFAC-T1-SAP.
           MOVE '11'          TO TIPO-REG-T1-SAP.
           MOVE '0003'        TO SOCIEDAD-T1-SAP.
           MOVE 451           TO NUM-ASTO-T1-SAP.
           MOVE 3             TO NUM-SERI-T1-SAP.
           MOVE 'EUR'         TO MONEDA-T1-SAP.
           MOVE SPACES        TO OF-CONT-RO-T1-SAP.
           MOVE RC37000-FPROCE    TO F-CONTABIL-T1-SAP.

           WRITE R-ASTOS-SAP.
           ADD 1 TO CT-SAPASTON.
      *
      *****************
       GRABAR-REG22.
      *****************
      *
           INITIALIZE R-ASTOS-SAP.

           MOVE '22'                      TO TIPO-REG-T2-SAP.
           MOVE '0003'                    TO SOCIEDAD-T2-SAP.
           MOVE 451                       TO NUM-ASTO-T2-SAP.
           MOVE 3                         TO NUM-SERI-T2-SAP.
           MOVE 693500                    TO CTA-CTBLE-T2-SAP.
           MOVE 'EUR'                     TO MONEDA-T2-SAP.
           MOVE RG-VEN0-KOFICINA          TO OF-CONT-RO-T2-SAP.
           MOVE RG-VEN0-KOFICINA          TO CENTRO-COS-T2-SAP.
           MOVE RC37000-FPROCE            TO F-CONTABIL-T2-SAP.
           MOVE ZEROES                    TO ORIG-GRUP-T2-SAP.
           MOVE ZEROES                    TO F-VALOR-T2-SAP.
           MOVE ZEROES                    TO NUM-EMPLE-T2-SAP.

           IF RG-VEN0-KMODALIDAD = 400

              PERFORM BUSCAR-MOD-ORIGEN

              IF RA562086-CRETORNO = ZEROS OR SPACES
                 MOVE SPACES               TO MODALID-T2-SAP
                 MOVE RA562086-KMOD-ORIGEN TO MODALID-T2-SAP(1:3)
                 MOVE RA562086-KMOD-ORIGEN TO WS-SAP-MODALIDAD
                 MOVE WS-SAP-KMODALIDAD  TO COB-GAR-T2-SAP
              ELSE
                 MOVE SPACES               TO COB-GAR-T2-SAP
                 MOVE SPACES               TO MODALID-T2-SAP
                 MOVE ZEROS                TO MODALID-T2-SAP(2:3)
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE RG-VEN0-KMODALIDAD TO MODALID-T2-SAP
              MOVE MODALID-T2-SAP(2:3) TO WS-SAP-MODALIDAD
              MOVE WS-SAP-KMODALIDAD  TO COB-GAR-T2-SAP
           END-IF

           MOVE 'VENCIMIENTOS MANUALES'   TO CONCEPT-T2-SAP.

           IF RG-CCV0-OK = 'N'
              COMPUTE IMP-DOC-T2-SAP = RG-VEN0-IMPCAPITAL +
                                                RG-VEN0-IMPBENEFICIOS
              MOVE IMP-DOC-T2-SAP     TO IMP-LOC-T2-SAP
           ELSE
              MOVE RG-CCV0-IMPCOA     TO IMP-DOC-T2-SAP
              MOVE RG-CCV0-IMPCOA     TO IMP-LOC-T2-SAP
           END-IF.

           COMPUTE IMP-DEBE = IMP-DEBE + IMP-DOC-T2-SAP.
           COMPUTE IMP-HABER = IMP-HABER + IMP-LOC-T2-SAP.

           MOVE 'D'                TO DEB-HAB-T2-SAP.

           WRITE R-ASTOS-SAP.
           ADD 1 TO CT-SAPASTON.
      *
       GRABAR-REG22-TOTALES.
      *****************
      *
           INITIALIZE R-ASTOS-SAP.
      *
           MOVE '22'                  TO TIPO-REG-T2-SAP.
           MOVE '0003'                TO SOCIEDAD-T2-SAP.
           MOVE 451                   TO NUM-ASTO-T2-SAP.
           MOVE 3                     TO NUM-SERI-T2-SAP.
           MOVE 350000                TO CTA-CTBLE-T2-SAP.
           MOVE 'EUR'                 TO MONEDA-T2-SAP.
           MOVE RC37000-FPROCE        TO F-CONTABIL-T2-SAP.
           MOVE ZEROES                TO ORIG-GRUP-T2-SAP.
           MOVE ZEROES                TO F-VALOR-T2-SAP.
           MOVE ZEROES                TO NUM-EMPLE-T2-SAP.
           MOVE IMP-DEBE              TO IMP-DOC-T2-SAP
           MOVE IMP-HABER             TO IMP-LOC-T2-SAP
           MOVE 'H'                   TO DEB-HAB-T2-SAP
           MOVE 'VENCIMIENTOS MANUALES'   TO CONCEPT-T2-SAP.

           WRITE R-ASTOS-SAP.
           ADD 1 TO CT-SAPASTON.

      *****************
       GRABAR-REG33.
      *****************
      *
           INITIALIZE R-ASTOS-SAP.

           MOVE '33'                  TO TIPO-REG-T3-SAP.
           MOVE '0003'                TO SOCIEDAD-T3-SAP.
           MOVE 451                   TO NUM-ASTO-T3-SAP.
           MOVE 3                     TO NUM-SERI-T3-SAP.
           MOVE 'EUR'                 TO MONEDA-T3-SAP.
           MOVE RG-VEN0-KOFICINA      TO OF-CONT-RO-T3-SAP.
           MOVE RC37000-FPROCE        TO F-CONTABIL-T3-SAP.
           MOVE IMP-DEBE              TO IMP-DEB-T3-SAP.
           MOVE IMP-HABER             TO IMP-HAB-T3-SAP.

           WRITE R-ASTOS-SAP.
           ADD 1 TO CT-SAPASTON.
      *
      *****************
       BUSCAR-MOD-ORIGEN.
      *****************
      *
           INITIALIZE RA562086.

           MOVE 'M'                          TO RA562086-COPERACION.
           MOVE RG-VEN0-KPOLIZA              TO RA562086-KPOLSUB.
           MOVE RG-VEN0-KCERTIFICADO         TO RA562086-KCERTI.
           MOVE '101'                        TO RA562086-KBENCON.

           CALL LT-VA562086 USING RA562086.
      *
      *****************************************************************
      * FIN DEL PROGRAMA.
      *****************************************************************
